    "notes": "The prompt, the expected graph and the plan target are authored in this repository; the export carries the datasets' identifiers only. The tracts are CDC/ATSDR's and the waterways USGS's (both public domain), the flood rasters SCOUT's (urban-toolkit/scout), used with the permission of its authors; their licence is to be confirmed."
